# Peer-dependency workaround (Phase 5B / T3 decision, see DECISIONS-LOG.md):
# @firebase/rules-unit-testing@6 peers on firebase ^13 while this project pins
# firebase ^12.19.0. legacy-peer-deps keeps the pinned firebase ^12 and makes
# `npm install` and `npm ci` behave identically everywhere (incl. CI).
legacy-peer-deps=true